@startuml

' Trigger: Auto-check win condition after player turn ends
GE -> GRV: Delegate check if current player meets win condition
note right: Monopoly Deal Win Condition: Collect 3 complete sets of properties in different colors
GRV -> PM: Get player's current property set information
PM --> GRV: Return player property details
GRV --> GE: Return check result (Win/No Win)

' Alternative branch: Win condition met or not
alt Player meets win condition, game ends
    GE -> GE: Lock game state, mark game ended
    GE -> PM: Mark current player as winner
    GE -> UM: Push game end event and winner information
    UM --> UI: Render game end screen, display winner and game details
    UI --> P: Display [Game Ended] and winner result to all players
else Player does not meet win condition, game continues
    GE -> GE: Execute player turn switch, initialize next player's turn
    GE -> UM: Sync game state, refresh UI
    UM --> UI: Update current turn player info, display next player turn entry
    UI --> P: Prompt [Turn switched], wait for next player action
end

@enduml